#: ../installation/update.rst:5
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Posodabljanje"

#: ../installation/update.rst:7
msgid "If you are using an old Galette release, it's time to update."
msgstr "Če uporabljate staro izdajo Galette, je čas za posodobitev."

#: ../installation/update.rst:11
msgid ""
"An update is often not something lite, your data may be modified. So, please "
"make sure you made **a backup of your current database**, or you may lost "
"all or a part of your data."
msgstr ""
"Posodobitev pogosto ni nekaj lahkega, vaši podatki se lahko spremenijo. Zato "
"poskrbite, da ste naredili **varnostno kopijo trenutne baze podatkov**, "
"sicer lahko izgubite vse ali del svojih podatkov."

#: ../installation/update.rst:13
msgid ""
"A backup of all Galette files is also recommended it would be helpful if you "
"find a bug that prevent you to migrate and have to restore an old version;"
msgstr ""
"Priporočljiva je tudi varnostna kopija vseh datotek Galette, kar bi bilo "
"koristno, če bi odkrili napako, ki vam preprečuje selitev in morate obnoviti "
"staro različico;"

#: ../installation/update.rst:17
msgid ""
"Updating from a 0.6x release is deprecated since Galette 1.3. It is not "
"tested anymore (those releases are more than 15 years old!), and your "
"attempt may fail."
msgstr ""
"Posodabljanje iz izdaje 0.6x je zastarelo od Galette 1.3. Ni več preizkušen "
"(te izdaje so stare več kot 15 let!) in vaš poskus morda ne uspe."

#: ../installation/update.rst:19
msgid ""
"If this is your case, you should first `migrate to Galette 0.7.8 <https://"
"galette.eu/download/archives/galette-0.7.8.tar.bz2>`_; and do another "
"migration to the latest version."
msgstr ""
"Če to velja za vas, morate najprej `preiti na različico Galette 0.7.8 "
"<https://galette.eu/download/archives/galette-0.7.8.tar.bz2>`_ in nato "
"izvesti še eno nadgradnjo na najnovejšo različico."

#: ../installation/update.rst:22
msgid "Updating files"
msgstr "Posodabljanje datotek"

#: ../installation/update.rst:24
msgid ""
"First, logout from your instance, and make sure to use a maintenance mode to "
"prevent other users to reach the instance."
msgstr ""
"Najprej se odjavite iz svojega primerka in se prepričajte, da uporabljate "
"vzdrževalni način, da preprečite drugim uporabnikom dostop do primerka."

#: ../installation/update.rst:26
msgid ""
"Then, download latest Galette version and replace the files. For more "
"information on files installation, refer to the :ref:`prepare installation "
"<preparation>` section."
msgstr ""
"Nato prenesite najnovejšo različico Galette in zamenjajte datoteke. Za več "
"informacij o namestitvi datotek glejte razdelek :ref:`prepare installation "
"<preparation>`."

#: ../installation/update.rst:28
msgid ""
"Some directories keep data and/or configurations and should be copied back "
"to the new instance:"
msgstr ""
"Nekateri imeniki hranijo podatke in/ali konfiguracije in jih je treba "
"kopirati nazaj v novo instanco:"

#: ../installation/update.rst:30
msgid ""
"``config/config.inc.php``. If the file is present, the update reads "
"everything from it - database password included - and never asks you for a "
"credential again. If it is missing, Galette cannot know it is an update: it "
"would offer a brand new installation instead,"
msgstr ""
"``config/config.inc.php``. Če je datoteka prisotna, posodobitev prebere vse "
"iz nje – vključno z geslom za bazo podatkov – in vas nikoli več ne vpraša za "
"poverilnico. Če manjka, Galette ne more vedeti, da gre za posodobitev: "
"namesto tega bi ponudila povsem novo namestitev,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:31
msgid "``data/photos`` your members photos and logos,"
msgstr "``data/photos`` fotografije in logotipi vaših članov,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:32
msgid "``data/exports`` contains CSv exports,"
msgstr "``data/exports`` vsebuje izvoze CSV,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:33
msgid "``data/files`` contains files from dynamic fields of type file,"
msgstr "``data/files`` vsebuje datoteke iz dinamičnih polj tipa file,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:34
msgid "``data/attachments`` contains mailing attached documents."
msgstr ""
"``data/attachments`` vsebuje priložene dokumente za pošiljanje po pošti."

#: ../installation/update.rst:35
msgid ""
"``plugins`` your current plugins. It is a good idea to check if new plugins "
"versions are available ;)"
msgstr ""
"``plugins`` vaši trenutni vtičniki. Priporočljivo je preveriti, ali so na "
"voljo nove različice vtičnikov ;)"

#: ../installation/update.rst:37
msgid ""
"Once files are updated, go to your Galette instance. It will ask you if "
"needed to proceed to the update of your database."
msgstr ""
"Ko so datoteke posodobljene, pojdite v svojo instanco Galette. Vprašal vas "
"bo, ali je treba nadaljevati s posodobitvijo baze podatkov."

#: ../installation/update.rst:39
msgid ""
"If so, :ref:`enable the installer <enableinstaller>` by creating the ``data/"
"ENABLE_INSTALL`` file, then visit the install URL ``/installer.php`` (ex: "
"https://your.domain.name/installer.php). Galette sees your configuration "
"file and runs an update, you have nothing to choose."
msgstr ""
"Če je tako, :ref:`omogočite namestitveni program <enableinstaller>` tako, da "
"ustvarite datoteko ``data/ENABLE_INSTALL``, nato obiščite namestitveni URL "
"``/installer.php`` (npr.: https://your.domain.name/installer.php). Galette "
"vidi vašo konfiguracijsko datoteko in zažene posodobitev, nimate česa "
"izbrati."

#: ../installation/update.rst:41
msgid "If it asks you nothing you're just done already ;)"
msgstr "Če te nič ne vpraša, si že končal ;)"

#: ../installation/update.rst:45
msgid "Updating database"
msgstr "Posodabljanje baze podatkov"

#: ../installation/update.rst:49
msgid ""
"Installing a new Galette release does not strictly means a database update "
"will be required! Sometimes, only updating the files will be enough; even "
"for a major release."
msgstr ""
"Namestitev nove izdaje Galette ne pomeni nujno, da bo potrebna posodobitev "
"baze podatkov! Včasih je dovolj le posodobitev datotek; tudi pri večji "
"izdaji."

#: ../installation/update.rst:51
msgid ""
"Galette will tell you if an update is needed, no need to \"force\" an update."
msgstr ""
"Galette vam bo povedal, če je potrebna posodobitev, ni vam treba \"force\" "
"posodobitve."

#: ../installation/update.rst:53
msgid ""
"Update process is very similar to :doc:`Galette installation process "
"<galette>`, with some steps that change. All is mostly transparent, "
"information are provided on each step."
msgstr ""
"Postopek posodabljanja je zelo podoben :doc:`postopku namestitve Galette "
"<galette>`, z nekaj spremembami v korakih. Vse je večinoma pregledno, "
"informacije so podane za vsak korak."

#: ../installation/update.rst:56
msgid "Database information"
msgstr "Informacije o zbirki podatkov"

#: ../installation/update.rst:60
msgid ""
"Database information are not asked anymore, and neither is the installation "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Podatki o bazi podatkov niso več zahtevani, prav tako ne vrsta namestitve."

#: ../installation/update.rst:62
msgid ""
"The update reads the database type, host, port, name, user, password and "
"table prefix from your configuration file, and goes straight to the access "
"and permissions check. The form only comes back if that file cannot be read "
"or is incomplete - fill it in with the very same information as before, the "
"table prefix included."
msgstr ""
"Posodobitev prebere vrsto baze podatkov, gostitelja, vrata, ime, uporabnika, "
"geslo in predpono tabele iz vaše konfiguracijske datoteke ter gre neposredno "
"na preverjanje dostopa in dovoljenj. Obrazec se vrne le, če te datoteke ni "
"mogoče prebrati ali je nepopolna - izpolnite jo z enakimi informacijami kot "
"prej, vključno s predpono tabele."

#: ../installation/update.rst:65
msgid "Previous version selection"
msgstr "Izbira prejšnje različice"

#: ../installation/update.rst:69
msgid "When the version can be read from the database, this step is skipped."
msgstr ""
"Ko je različico mogoče prebrati iz baze podatkov, se ta korak preskoči."

#: ../installation/update.rst:71
msgid ""
"Galette reads the version its database holds and updates from there. The "
"step below is only displayed when that reading is not conclusive - which is "
"the case for a pre 0.7 database, since the table holding the version did not "
"exist yet. Select the version you are coming from, the one Galette guessed "
"is displayed as bold text:"
msgstr ""
"Galette prebere različico, ki jo ima njena baza podatkov, in jo posodablja "
"od tam. Spodnji korak je prikazan le, če to branje ni dokončno - kar velja "
"za zbirko podatkov pred 0.7, ker tabela z različico še ni obstajala. "
"Izberite različico, iz katere prihajate, tista, ki jo je Galette uganila, je "
"prikazana kot krepko besedilo:"

#: ../installation/update.rst:77
msgid ""
"The step is also displayed when your database is already up to date, so you "
"get a chance to stop before running the scripts again:"
msgstr ""
"Korak je prikazan tudi, ko je vaša baza podatkov že posodobljena, tako da "
"imate možnost, da se ustavite, preden znova zaženete skripte:"

#: ../installation/update.rst:83
msgid "Once update scripts have run, a summary will be displayed."
msgstr "Ko se posodobitveni skripti zaženejo, se prikaže povzetek."

#: ../installation/update.rst:87
msgid ""
"The ``data/ENABLE_INSTALL`` file is removed once the update has completed."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka ``data/ENABLE_INSTALL`` se odstrani, ko je posodobitev končana."

